1
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:20,999
My name is Chandrakumar. I am from Kollam district. I have come to this altar to share my testimony about the healing I received.

2
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:37,999
I thank Mother Mary and Jesus for giving me the grace to come here and share this testimony. On 8/1/2024 — I made the covenant for the first time.

3
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:43,999
I was abroad, and during my leave I came here and took the covenant. But just as Father had said,

4
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,999
I was not able to complete that covenant. Before I could, I had to return.

5
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:59,999
Even then, every night before sleeping and every morning after waking up, I continued to pray to Mother Mary and to Jesus.

6
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:12,999
And then, on 7 February 2025, I came back home. On 7 February, around five in the evening, I suddenly had severe chest pain.

7
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:23,999
When I say chest pain, it was an unbearable pain. After about an hour, the pain shifted down to my lower abdomen. We went to the hospital, took medicines, and came back.

8
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:27,999
By around 9 at night, I could no longer stand.

9
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:31,999
Again we called a vehicle and went to the hospital. Then they shifted me to Medicity Hospital.

10
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:38,999
After the X-ray and scanning, the doctor said my intestine had ruptured — an ulcer had burst.

11
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:45,999
He said it could not be left like that and that surgery had to be done immediately. Around 12:30 at night, I was taken into the operation theatre.

12
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:50,999
They said the surgery finished by around 5.30 in the morning, but I have no memory of it.

13
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:59,999
On the eighth day, my biopsy result came — it was cancer. On the ninth day, I was discharged from there.

14
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:04,999
After a week, when I went for a check-up, the doctor told me to take the slide to RCC and give it to the pathology lab.

15
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:08,999
They had a doubt and asked me to submit it there anyway.

16
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:18,999
After about one and a half months, the result came from there, confirming that it was cancer. With that result in hand, we returned to Medicity Hospital.

17
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:28,999
It has only been two months. You have already spent nearly two and a half lakh rupees in these eight days. After seeing the result, the doctor said,

18
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:36,999
“Now another surgery must be done. Earlier, when it burst, we only stitched the area. Now that part has to be removed completely."

19
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:38,999
I told the doctor I no longer had the financial means for that.

20
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:43,999
And refer me to RCC. But they did not give the referral letter. The next day,

21
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:49,999
with the papers we had, we went to RCC. But without a reference letter, they said they could not take me.

22
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:54,999
We then went to the community office and explained everything. The doctor there wrote the referral letter and told us to take it quickly and register.

23
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:58,999
We registered, and four or five doctors examined me thoroughly.

24
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:03,999
After that, they sent me to the surgeon. After looking at all the results, the surgeon said,

25
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:15,999
“This is cancer that burst. Surgery will definitely be needed. First, the tests here must be completed.” They gave me a date — April 28.

26
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:19,999
On April 28, I underwent a CT scan; on May 8,

27
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:24,999
I had an endoscopy. That same day, they took another biopsy and sent it to the lab.

28
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:38,999
Throughout all these tests, the only thing I carried was the covenant medal, and I said to Mother Mary: “Mother, please do not let this disease be found in my body.” On May 19,

29
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:42,999
I came here again and renewed my covenant.

30
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:49,999
I took the token and met Father. He blessed me, placed his hand with the sign of the cross on my head,

31
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:53,999
and anointed me. On May 22, we went to meet the doctor.

32
00:03:54,000 --> 00:04:08,999
The surgeon was in the operation theatre, so another doctor called me. He looked at the slide result from RCC and the result given by Medicity Hospital. He couldn’t understand anything.

33
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:14,999
He said, “Did you have hernia issues earlier?" I said, "No, I only had a sharp pain on my stomach". Then the doctor said,

34
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:25,999
“Your endoscopy is negative, CT is negative, biopsy is negative. Nothing is showing inside. Still, let the surgeon decide.”

35
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:28,999
So the surgeon came.

36
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:40,999
But the surgeon was not agreeing at all. He was holding on only to that biopsy report. He said, “There are only two options: either we remove this entire portion,

37
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:43,999
or we leave it as it is and treat it later if disease develops.”

38
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:51,999
That same day he wrote a CT scan for June 7 and gave me a letter to take to Medicity Hospital.

39
00:04:52,000 --> 00:05:02,999
He said, “We cannot find your ruptured area. Medicity saw it only through X-ray and said your intestine had burst.

40
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:13,999
They did CT, endoscopy, and everything—but even then the ruptured area or diseased portion is not visible here. Then he gave an example: “If a tyre gets punctured,

41
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:19,999
the puncture will always remain. But in your body, we cannot see where the rupture happened; we cannot find the diseased area.

42
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:27,999
That is why I say the whole portion should be removed.” He then gave me another letter addressed to Medicity Hospital,

43
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:31,999
asking them to clearly mark the exact point from where they had taken the biopsy.

44
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:36,999
The next day, we went to Medicity. The doctor there wrote that the issue was in the stomach region.

45
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:43,999
Earlier, he had said my intestine had ruptured. When he now wrote “stomach region,” I became scared again.

46
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:50,999
We came here again, prayed, and took a token to meet Father. Father placed the sign of the cross on my head and prayed,

47
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:54,999
but he didn’t anoint me with oil that day.

48
00:05:55,000 --> 00:06:00,999
When I came out, my wife asked, “Why didn’t Father apply the oil today?” I told her,

49
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:14,999
“I’ve heard that when Father touches someone’s head, he can understand their illness. Maybe… maybe there is nothing to see in me.” We were waiting for the CT result on June 7,

50
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:20,999
and on June 11 we went to meet the doctor again. The CT was negative.

51
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:27,999
The surgeon again said, “We must remove the stomach. You had a disease, but we are unable to detect it.

52
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:33,999
What kind of situation is this—that we must remove a healthy stomach because we cannot find the illness?” “If you leave it,

53
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:36,999
the disease may appear later. So it must be removed.” “There is no other way; it has to be removed."

54
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:43,999
Then I told the doctor, “When I underwent surgery, my weight was 61 kg. Before that, my normal weight was 76 kg. After the surgery,

55
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:53,999
my weight suddenly increased again — it became 70 kg. I have no difficulty eating, no difficulty passing motion, and no other discomfort at all.” I said,

56
00:06:54,000 --> 00:07:01,999
“Doctor, if any illness comes, I will come. But right now, I do not want an operation.” Hearing my argument,

57
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:07,999
the surgeon closed my file and said, “Go and meet the doctor you first consulted.” So on June 19,

58
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:09,999
we went to meet that doctor. That day he checked all the results. After verifying everything, he said, “How can I simply send you away?"

59
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:18,999
we went to meet that doctor. That day he checked all the results. After verifying everything, he said, “How can I simply send you away?

60
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:23,999
Nothing is clear. Instead of removing a healthy stomach, let’s wait two or three months and do one more test.”

61
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:29,999
I agreed to that. Instead of the wrong decision to remove my stomach.

62
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:33,999
Then he said, “Let me discuss this with the surgeon.” I told him,

63
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:38,999
“Sir, the surgeon is the one insisting that my stomach must be removed.” He replied,

64
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:44,999
“That’s okay. You wait here.” He went and spoke to the surgeon and returned saying, “We can do one more test.

65
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:53,999
It can be done at KIMS Hospital, or Cosmopolitan Hospital, or Ananthapuri Hospital — any of the three.” He wrote a letter and told me,

66
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:59,999
“Go to whichever hospital you prefer, do the test, and bring the result within two weeks.” So on July 3,

67
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:04,999
we went to KIMS with the letter. They said the test would cost ₹30,000.

68
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:10,999
It was done with a camera and mic — a very detailed test to detect even the smallest issues.

69
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:20,999
Then my wife and I went inside to meet the doctor. He asked, “Who is the patient?” I said, “Sir, it’s me.” He asked if I had any weight loss.

70
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:30,999
I explained my situation. He said, “Anyway, let’s check. But 90% chances are that we won’t find anything inside.” They sedated me and completed all the tests.

71
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:37,999
Around 2 PM I regained consciousness. Except for the biopsy, all other results had come. We went to the doctor with the results.

72
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:46,999
The report showed nothing indicating cancer. The doctor said, “You may go home without fear.” He told me to take this report back to RCC.

73
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:58,999
When I went to RCC with that report, the doctor there said, “We can start chemo.” I asked, “On what basis will you give chemo to a body with no disease?” The doctor himself said,

74
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:03,999
“We cannot be sure if chemo will work or not.” I said, “Don’t do anything to me now."

75
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:10,999
Because when I first took the covenant and went home to pray, I felt a beautiful fragrance.

76
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:20,999
But the second time I took the covenant, I didn’t receive any sign. I listen to Father’s prayer every morning, evening, and night.

77
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:35,999
That day I prayed, “Mother, I have heard the testimonies of others — that they saw you in dreams. Mother, please appear to me also in a dream.” After praying I went to bed.

78
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:43,999
The next day, in the evening, when I lit the green candle for prayer, Mother’s image appeared clearly to me.

79
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:52,999
I posted it on Facebook too. From that moment I had complete faith — whatever the doctors say, my Mother is with me. I had no fear.

80
00:09:53,000 --> 00:10:02,999
It has now been ten months. I have no discomfort at all. The KIMS doctor had said, “Go home boldly. Your body shows no trace of cancer.”

81
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:11,999
But RCC had confirmed cancer based on the signed report from Medicity Hospital, the same report that said I had cancer.

82
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:19,999
Based on that, RCC insisted my stomach should be removed. But now it’s the 10th month, and I have no illness at all.

83
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:25,999
The doctor told me, “Stay courageous.” My weight is now 70 kg. I have no trouble eating, no discomfort.

84
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:39,999
Mother Mary and Lord Jesus gave me back my life. I have endless gratitude for that. I used Covenant Oil everyday morning and evening to my body.

85
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:50,999
I used to have severe knee pain every day — all that pain disappeared. After my surgery, my wife developed a growth in her uterus.

86
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:58,999
Later, three to four more growths appeared. We didn’t know what it was. We did a scan and went to a gynecologist.

87
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:09,999
She said it must be removed. But by Mother’s mercy, everything disappeared without any problems. My wife was restored to me.

88
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:16,999
For all of this, I offer countless thanks to Mother Mary and Lord Jesus. Also, I had no house… Last Sunday,

89
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:27,999
we completed laying the foundation stone of my house. It will be a 1600 sq. ft. house. The construction work will begin this coming week.

90
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:34,999
I had nothing, yet today I have reached this stage — how can I thank my Mother and my Lord Jesus enough?

91
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:41,999
Until the day I die, I will remain indebted for this grace. I tell everyone about my experience. I shared it with all the people in my hometown.

92
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:52,999
If you have troubles, you must go there and tell Mother. I used to tell everyone my testimony. I would take the newsletters to every hospital and house… I would give it to people.

93
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:57,999
About the Charity work, In Hospitals, I would buy food and give it to them.

94
00:11:58,000 --> 00:12:04,999
My Mother and my Lord Jesus gave me back my life. I thank Them with countless gratitude. I conclude.

95
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:14,999
By remembering His wondrous works. The Lord is gracious and full of compassion.

96
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:29,999
He gives food to His faithful ones. He always remembers His covenant. The purpose of the covenant is faithfulness. — Chandrakumar B From the testimony given to us,

97
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:42,999
we understand that the blessings of the covenant were received only when the covenant conditions were kept faithfully.

98
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:58,999
The promised presence of the Mother — that is, the constant presence, protection, and nearness of Mother — was experienced by him only because… He and his family always shared everything with Mother,

99
00:12:59,000 --> 00:13:03,999
living in a deep relationship.

100
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:17,999
That is why Mother turned every situation in their life into a testimony that glorified Jesus. The covenant is the promised presence of God.

101
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:31,999
Every day, morning and evening, while praying, the sight of Mother’s image glowing through the candlelight was a sign of Her presence. Just as the prophet Isaiah said… “I will go before you,

102
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:37,999
make the mountains level, break down the bronze gates, cut through the iron bars,

103
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:43,999
and give you the treasures of darkness and hidden riches.” This is the active, helping presence.

104
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:55,999
It is through this constant presence of Jesus and Mother that Chandrakumar and his wife were healed from the grip of the deadly disease, cancer.

105
00:13:56,000 --> 00:14:07,999
They have come to thank our Mother for this grace. By following the living example of the Holy Mother, listening to God’s Word, and living according to it…

106
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:21,999
It is by doing this that they received the blessing to live filled with divine grace, just like the Holy Mother. In our own lives… When we face difficulties like sickness,

107
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:36,999
debt, suffering, and problems, we too can pray with faith in Jesus and Mother, following the Marian Way for spiritual purification and strengthening.

108
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:46,999
Through prayer and through the life of the Marian Covenant, our devotion and faith can also be strengthened. For all the blessings given to Chandrakumar and his family…

109
00:14:47,000 --> 00:14:57,999
Especially the healing from sickness and the blessing of receiving a good house — let us thank the Holy Mother and Jesus, clap our hands, and offer their testimony.

110
00:14:58,000 --> 00:15:09,999
Extraordinary divine experiences can become yours too. If you have not yet subscribed to this YouTube channel, do it now…

111
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:14,000
Share this video with your friends and become messengers of the Lord.
